  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilience Program for Bridge Infrastructure in the Dominican Republic</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Resiliencia Climtica de la Infraestructura de Puentes en Repblica Dominicana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir al crecimiento econmico sostenido e inclusivo de Repblica Dominicana. El objetivo especfico es mejorar la resiliencia climtica de la infraestructura de puentes del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to contribute to the sustained and inclusive economic growth of the Dominican Republic. The specific objective is to improve the climate resilience of the country&apos;s bridgeinfrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
